    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/4/44975.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "No, I think that's super true. So you mentioned this earlier, but as being part of the largest record-breaking freshman class of Republican women for the U.S. House, what would be one of your top takeaways from serving your community in that capacity from a little bit over the past year, almost year and a half?",
